---- MODULE History ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from history.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart history.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES main
vars == <<main>>

\* Region Main
mainStates == {"Reading", "Ready", "Refused", "Stale", "Unavailable"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ main \in mainStates

Init ==
    /\ main = "Reading"

\* sources read
SourcesRead ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Reading" /\ main' = "Ready")

\* source fails
SourceFails ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Reading" /\ main' = "Unavailable")

\* continue after audit or unrelated write
ContinueAfterAuditOrUnrelatedWrite ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Ready" /\ main' = "Ready")

\* supported source content changes
SupportedSourceContentChanges ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Ready" /\ main' = "Stale")

\* actor or deal changes
ActorOrDealChanges ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Ready" /\ main' = "Refused")

\* refresh
Refresh ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Stale" /\ main' = "Reading")

\* retry
Retry ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Unavailable" /\ main' = "Reading")

\* authorized fresh read
AuthorizedFreshRead ==
    /\ \/ (main = "Refused" /\ main' = "Reading")

Next == SourcesRead \/ SourceFails \/ ContinueAfterAuditOrUnrelatedWrite \/ SupportedSourceContentChanges \/ ActorOrDealChanges \/ Refresh \/ Retry \/ AuthorizedFreshRead

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

